<div class="about">
    <div class="about-icon"><img src="appicon.png" alt="" /></div>
    <div class="about-name">AJxCAD</div>
    <div class="about-version">Version @AppInfo.VersionString</div>
    <p>A focused 2D CAD workspace for macOS and Windows. Draw, refine and organise your ideas on an adaptive grid.</p>
    <dl class="about-keys">
        <dt>Draw &amp; edit</dt><dd>Connected lines, grid and endpoint snapping, shared-corner editing and undo.</dd>
        <dt>Navigate &amp; measure</dt><dd>Cursor-centred zoom, pan, origin centring and configurable metric or imperial scale.</dd>
        <dt>Project files</dt><dd>Save and open .ajx files with drawing data, a project title, scale settings and the saved view.</dd>
        <dt>Inspect your data</dt><dd>Explore project and drawing data in the read-only Data buckets viewer.</dd>
        <dt>Your workspace</dt><dd>Choose full visual effects or performance mode, with an optional debug log.</dd>
    </dl>
    <p class="about-note">Built with .NET MAUI and Blazor.</p>
    <p class="about-note">Open Help → User guide for getting started, project settings and keyboard shortcuts.</p>
</div>
